{"code":"        effective_timeout = max(0, timeout_ms - clock_skew_ms)  # clamp so skew cannot drive timeout negative
        self.store[key] = {
            "acquired_at": time.monotonic(),
            "timeout_ms": effective_timeout,
        }
        self.held_keys.add(key)
        return {
            "key": key,
            "effective_timeout_ms": effective_timeout,
            "acquired": True,
        }","comments":"Clamp the adjusted timeout to zero so clock skew never makes it negative prior to storing/returning it."}
